<notes>
NoteIn the first example, the Manhattan distance between any two cells is smaller than $$$3$$$, so the answer is $$$0$$$.In the second example, a possible solution is $$$(1,1)(3,2)$$$, $$$(1,2)(3,3)$$$, $$$(2,1)(1,3)$$$, $$$(3,1)(2,3)$$$.
</notes>

